chung.Description:
-Objective:

• Understand the concepts of international travel and related topics;

• Be familiar with world’s major tourism destinations;

• Perceive and classify tourism resources and its meanings;

• Introduce famous destinations in Vietnam;

• Build specific routes and itineraries of travel destinations.

-Description: This course introduces the overview about international tourism major destinations as well as Vietnamese ones. It provides understandings and knowledge about the general organization of tourism geography. Furthermore, it researches about tourism resources, its potentials and its relationships based on the division of locations and typography. Therefore, it helps the students to have orientations and plans in using and exploiting tourism resources properly. This subject also improves the student’s awareness of protecting and responding to tourism environment and provides them with interdisciplinary knowledge and skills essential to further study in specialization.
